# Navigating the Unfriendly Seas' edges. The offer's operands, each false alone (Luck of the Draw completed for all):
# bob: Equipped for All Occasions accepted, not completed (its Prog 0: qm6 nil): NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY; carl: a
# Warrior; dan: a level 49 Corsair, also at AF2_QUEST_LEVEL 49.4 (a number). Main (accepted by a GM, a Hydrogauge): the
# gauge to the Leypoint at Prog 0: nil; at Prog 3 (a GM): nil; the Leypoint at Prog 3: nil: LEYPOINT; Prog 0 (a GM): the
# gauge to Leleroon: 283; Prog 2 set by a GM with 283 open: its finish tests Prog again: nothing (Prog 2 kept); Leleroon
# at Prog 2: 292; qm6 at Prog 4 (a GM): nil: NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY; its 233 at Prog 3 with a full bag: complete false
# (unread): nothing; room again: 233: completed.
lists ArrapagoReef/qm6/onTrigger Nashmau/Leleroon/onTrigger WajaomWoodlands/Leypoint/onTrade WajaomWoodlands/Leypoint/onTrigger ArrapagoReef/onEventFinish/233
char zone=WajaomWoodlands pos=-198.527,-8.5,80.058 job=COR lvl=50
char bob zone=ArrapagoReef pos=470.267,-12.292,111.817 job=COR lvl=50
char carl zone=ArrapagoReef pos=470.267,-12.292,111.817 job=WAR lvl=50
char dan zone=ArrapagoReef pos=470.267,-12.292,111.817 job=COR lvl=49
